{"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLOpus\/Score\/xlink"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL","doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLOpus","doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLOpus\/Score"]]},"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"text":"let","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"xlink","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"MXLXLink","preciseIdentifier":"s:7IvorMXL8MXLXLinkV","kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLXLink"}]}],"kind":"declarations"}],"abstract":[{"text":"The link-attributes group includes all the simple XLink attributes supported in the MusicXML format. It is","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"also used to connect a MusicXML score with MusicXML parts or a MusicXML opus.","type":"text"}],"sections":[],"metadata":{"externalID":"s:7IvorMXL7MXLOpusV5ScoreV5xlinkAA8MXLXLinkVvp","fragments":[{"text":"let","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"xlink","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"MXLXLink","preciseIdentifier":"s:7IvorMXL8MXLXLinkV","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"role":"symbol","modules":[{"name":"IvorMXL"}],"title":"xlink","roleHeading":"Instance Property","symbolKind":"property"},"kind":"symbol","variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/ivormxl\/mxlopus\/score\/xlink"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"references":{"doc://IvorMXL/documentation/IvorMXL":{"url":"\/documentation\/ivormxl","kind":"symbol","type":"topic","role":"collection","title":"IvorMXL","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A MusicXML parser, normalizer, validator, and formatter."}]},"doc://IvorMXL/documentation/IvorMXL/MXLXLink":{"kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/ivormxl\/mxlxlink","title":"MXLXLink","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"MXLXLink"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"MXLXLink","kind":"identifier"}],"abstract":[{"text":"The simple XLink attributes supported in the MusicXML format. It is also used to connect a MusicXML score with","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"MusicXML parts or a MusicXML opus.","type":"text"}],"type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLXLink"},"doc://IvorMXL/documentation/IvorMXL/MXLOpus":{"title":"MXLOpus","url":"\/documentation\/ivormxl\/mxlopus","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The opus type is used for the root element of a MusicXML opus. Each opus is made up of a series of score,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"opus-link, and\/or nested opus elements. The document-attributes attribute group includes the version"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"attribute. Future versions may include more metadata elements. In this version, we just include the title of"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the opus."}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"MXLOpus"}],"kind":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"MXLOpus"}],"type":"topic","role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLOpus"},"doc://IvorMXL/documentation/IvorMXL/MXLOpus/Score":{"title":"MXLOpus.Score","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The score elements provide the links to the individual scores within an opus. The new-page attribute, added in"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Version 2.0, is used to indicate if the first page of the score is different than the last page of the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"previous score. If new-page is “yes”, then a different page is used; if “no”, then the same page is used. The"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"default value is implementation-dependent."}],"url":"\/documentation\/ivormxl\/mxlopus\/score","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"Score"}],"kind":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"Score"}],"type":"topic","role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLOpus\/Score"},"doc://IvorMXL/documentation/IvorMXL/MXLOpus/Score/xlink":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLOpus\/Score\/xlink","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"let","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"xlink","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"MXLXLink","preciseIdentifier":"s:7IvorMXL8MXLXLinkV","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"title":"xlink","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The link-attributes group includes all the simple XLink attributes supported in the MusicXML format. It is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"also used to connect a MusicXML score with MusicXML parts or a MusicXML opus."}],"type":"topic","kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/ivormxl\/mxlopus\/score\/xlink"}}}